   508→  /**
   509→   * An alternate implementation of {@link Types#asElement} that does not require a {@link Types}
   510→   * instance with the notable difference that it will throw {@link IllegalArgumentException}
   511→   * instead of returning null if the {@link TypeMirror} can not be converted to an {@link Element}.
   512→   *
   513→   * @throws NullPointerException if {@code typeMirror} is {@code null}
   514→   * @throws IllegalArgumentException if {@code typeMirror} cannot be converted to an
   515→   *     {@link Element}
